flowchart LR
  browser[Browser] --> forward[Loopback port-forward]
  forward --> frontend[Dashboard Service / Deployment]
  frontend --> api[API Service / Deployment]
  api --> postgres[PostgreSQL Service / PVC]
  api --> redis[Redis Service / PVC]
  migration[Versioned migration Job] --> postgres
  worker[Worker Deployment] --> postgres
  worker --> redis
  policy[Namespace network policy / scoped service accounts] -.-> api
